@startuml 04-lifecycle-flow

title Lifecycle - Fowler SPDD + SDLC hybrid with storage v3 gates

|Planning|
start
:/sdlc-spdd-init
seed sdlc-spdd/ layout,
empty ledger + registry;
:requirement / milestone
requirements/milestones/<WORK-ID>.md;
:claim work
./scripts/sdlc.sh claim
-> registry.jsonl event;

|Design|
:/sdlc-spdd-analysis
retrieve --kind analysis,
write spdd/analysis/<WORK-ID>-analysis.md,
stage one analysis record;
:/sdlc-spdd-plan
write REASONS canvas
spdd/canvas/<WORK-ID>.md;
:/sdlc-spdd-architect
retrieve --kind decision,
harden canvas (no code);

|Build|
:/sdlc-spdd-code
retrieve --kind pitfall,
implement ONE canvas operation,
capture progress -> staged;
:/sdlc-spdd-api-test
verify canvas Requirements/Operations,
capture note -> staged;

|Verify|
:/sdlc-spdd-review
retrieve --kind pattern,
write spdd/reviews/<WORK-ID>-review.md;

|Learn|
:/sdlc-spdd-retro
stage decision / pitfall / pattern,
./scripts/sdlc.sh accept --work-id
-> promote staged to lessons.jsonl;
:/sdlc-spdd-sync
write spdd/sync/<WORK-ID>-sync.md,
accept remaining records,
release claim -> registry.jsonl;
:one batched git commit
(contracts + accepted ledger);
stop

@enduml
